kground:linear-gradient(145deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #d35400}.food-item h4{margin:0 0 8px;color:#d35400;font-size:1.05rem}.dish-desc{color:#7f8c8d;font-style:italic;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:.9rem}.food-item p{margin:8px 0;line-height:1.6;font-size:.95rem}.food-item ul{margin:5px 0;padding-left:20px;line-height:1.8;font-size:.9rem}.food-item strong{color:#2c3e50}.key-points{display:grid;gap:10px}.point{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fef5e7,transparent);padding:16px 22px;border-left:4px solid #f39c12;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}</style>","quiz":[{"question":"Cannonau 與哪個國際品種是同一品種？","options":["Cabernet Sauvignon","Grenache / Garnacha","Merlot","Syrah"],"answer":1,"explanation":"DNA 研究證明 Cannonau 與西班牙的 Garnacha、法國的 Grenache 是同一品種，但 Sardinia 版本風格獨特。"},{"question":"Vermentino di Gallura 有什麼特別之處？","options":["產量最大","Sardinia 唯一的 DOCG","酒精度最低","只產紅酒"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Vermentino di Gallura 在 1996 年升級為 DOCG，是 Sardinia 唯一的 DOCG 產區。"},{"question":"Carignano del Sulcis 的特點是？","options":["沒有老藤","擁有自根老藤（未嫁接、100+ 年）","只產白酒","產量極大"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Sulcis 的沙質土壤抗根瘤蚜蟲，許多葡萄園保留自根老藤（ungrafted），樹齡 100+ 年。"},{"question":"Bottarga 是什麼？","options":["一種起司","鯔魚卵","一種葡萄品種","一種甜點"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Bottarga 是鯔魚卵，是 Sardinia 的高級食材，通常刨絲配義大利麵或麵包，搭配 Vermentino 白酒完美。"}]}
